# Splash Screen Protection

- Treat the splash-screen implementation as locked by default.
- Do not modify splash-related code unless the user explicitly requests splash changes.
- Protected files:
  - `index.html` (splash markup)
  - `styles/main.css` (splash styles/animations)
  - `js/main.js` (splash timing/exit logic)
- When editing these files for unrelated work, preserve all splash behavior exactly:
  - Black full-screen overlay on load
  - Centered "Jamie Setch" text
  - 1 second hold before exit
  - "Jamie" moves left and "Setch" moves right
  - Splash fades out into the page
